#: deathforth/news/news.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/news/news.df"
msgid "We're quick to respond to feedback and suggestions on Twitter!"
msgstr "트위터의 의견과 제안에는 빠르게 답변합니다!"

#: deathforth/news/news.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/news/news.df"
msgid "Rocketcat Twitter"
